OL,3,AEmergency measures needed to stop
OL,4,Ateachers quitting, say Lib Dems
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnt out teachers urgently need better
OL,7,Fworking hours and more support to stop
OL,8,Fthem leaving the profession, the
OL,9,FLiberal Democrats say, as the new term
OL,10,Fapproaches.
OL,12,FNearly half of the teachers surveyed by
OL,13,Fthe party in England said they were
OL,14,Fplanning to quit the classroom in the
OL,15,Fnext five years, with many saying they
OL,16,Ffelt overworked and stressed.
OL,18,FThe Lib Dems are urging new Education
OL,19,FSecretary Lucy Powell to fully fund
OL,20,Fteachers' pay, rather than raiding
OL,21,Fschool budgets to cover increases, and
OL,22,Fto bring in limits on overtime.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
