OL,3,AEmergency measures needed to stop
OL,4,Ateachers quitting, say Lib Dems
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Education said last
OL,7,Fyear saw the lowest rate of teachers
OL,8,Fleaving the profession since 2010 but
OL,9,Facknowledged there was "more to do".
